      "solar_powered_gps_tags_2026": "Solar-powered GPS tags (now as small as 1g) transmit location data via satellite. They reveal exact routes, stopover timing, and flight altitude. The record 8,425-mile non-stop Godwit flight, Alaska to Tasmania in 2022, was tracked this way.",
