      "eugenics_origins_larry_p_atkins_proces": "Eugenics origins, Larry P., Atkins, processing-speed penalties, ADA accommodations.",
      "every_inventory_here_is_for_education_": "Every inventory here is for education and self-reflection, not diagnosis. Real clinical/educational decisions require a qualified professional administering a full validated battery.",
      "everything_you_need_to_adopt_this_tool": "Everything you need to adopt this tool in a Psychology, Education, School Psychology, or Industrial/Organizational Psych course. The content is built for undergraduate and graduate teaching; pick what fits your level.",
