      "explorer_desc": "Browse the full career registry. Filter by cluster, RIASEC, education, salary, growth. Each career has BLS data + day-in-life + skills + honest pros/cons + a network of related careers to traverse.",
      "family_work_desc": "5 sections: the reality of family + career tradeoffs, parenting + career, parental leave navigation, elder + family caregiving, dual-career couples. Honest about tradeoffs the marketing slogans don't mention.",
      "filter_by_term_definition_or_module": "Filter by term, definition, or module",
      "first_90_desc": "6 sections (Watkins framework): overview + 5-stage approach, first week priorities, first month focus, days 31-60, days 61-90, common mistakes. The trajectory of your tenure is set in the first 90 days.",
      "five_dimension_rubric_for_grading_stud": "Five-dimension rubric for grading student work on assignments using this tool. Each dimension scored 1-4 (Beginning, Developing, Proficient, Excellent). Customize by weighting dimensions for your course emphasis.",
      "flynn_gains_mean_old_norms_over_qualif": "Flynn gains mean old norms over-qualify students for giftedness and under-qualify for ID.",
      "freetools_desc": "7 categories of public-domain + research-validated assessment instruments: cognitive, personality, career + values, mental health screening, academic + reading, social-emotional, adaptive behavior. ~40 tools curated.",
      "gardner_s_multiple_intelligences": "Gardner's Multiple Intelligences",
      "general_intelligence_g": " (general intelligence, g), ",
      "glossary": "Glossary",
      "glossary_filter_accessible_label": "Filter glossary terms",
      "goals_pro_desc": "5 sections: research base (Locke + Latham), frameworks (SMART, OKRs, Atomic Habits, WOOP, BHAGs), review cycles (daily through annual), self-sabotage patterns, career-long professional development plan template.",
      "harm": "● harm",
