      "current_detection_programs": "Current detection programs: ",
      "cygnus": "Cygnus",
      "dark_energy_accelerating_expansion": "Dark energy + accelerating expansion",
      "dark_matter_dark_energy": "Dark matter + dark energy: ",
      "dart_mission_2022_first_deflection_tes": "DART mission 2022 (first deflection test)",
      "dart_nasa_2022_double_asteroid_redirec": "DART (NASA, 2022, Double Asteroid Redirection Test) was the FIRST test of asteroid deflection: a ~ 600 kg spacecraft deliberately crashed into the moon Dimorphos of the asteroid Didymos at 6.1 km/s. The impact CHANGED Dimorphos's orbital period around Didymos by ~ 33 minutes — far more than predicted, because the impact ejected enough material to provide ADDITIONAL momentum (the \"ejecta enhancement factor\"). HERA (ESA, launched 2024, arriving Didymos 2026) will follow up with detailed observation of the crater + Dimorphos's changed properties. The lesson: kinetic impactors WORK on small asteroids if given enough warning. For a Tunguska-class threat (50-100m), several years' warning + a DART-class mission could deflect it. For city-killer (~ 1km), decades + multiple impactors. For dinosaur-killer (10+km), we currently have no proven defense.",
      "dawes_limit": "Dawes limit: ",
      "days_into_the_lunar_cycle": " days into the lunar cycle).",
      "daytime_note": "☀ Daytime — stars are up but the Sun outshines them",
      "de_mairan_s_nebula": "De Mairan's Nebula",
      "dec_1972_taurus_littrow_valley_cernan_": "(Dec 1972) — Taurus-Littrow valley. Cernan + Schmitt (only geologist to walk on the Moon). The last people to leave the Moon. The Artemis program plans to return crews starting in the late 2020s.",
      "december_13_14_the_strongest_most_reli": "December 13-14. The strongest, most reliable shower. ~120 per hour in dark skies. Cold but worth it.",
      "decolonizing_astronomy": "Decolonizing astronomy",
      "deep_sky_imaging_dsos": "Deep-sky imaging (DSOs)",
      "deflection_options": "Deflection options: ",
      "delphinus": "Delphinus",
      "delta_cephei": "Delta Cephei",
      "deneb": "Deneb",
      "deneb_2": "Deneb",
      "deneb_3": "Deneb",
      "design_note_discrete_5_category_star_m": "Design note: discrete 5-category star marker; no luminosity-class score; no reveal — by design.",
      "detonate_a_nuclear_device_near_not_on_": "Detonate a nuclear device NEAR (not on) the asteroid; the ablation push deflects it. Theoretically powerful, politically + technically fraught.",
      "different_detector_designs_sense_diffe": "Different detector designs sense different frequencies. LIGO + Virgo + KAGRA (4 km laser interferometers, ground-based) detect 10-2000 Hz — the audible-range \"chirps\" of stellar-mass compact binaries in the final seconds before merger. LISA (Laser Interferometer Space Antenna, ESA-led, launch ~2035) will be three spacecraft in solar orbit forming arms ~2.5 million km long, sensitive to 10⁻⁴ to 10⁻¹ Hz — supermassive BH mergers, double white dwarfs, extreme mass-ratio inspirals. Pulsar Timing Arrays (NANOGrav, EPTA, others) monitor millisecond pulsars over decades, sensitive to 10⁻⁹ to 10⁻⁷ Hz — supermassive BH mergers building up an isotropic stochastic background. In 2023 NANOGrav + EPTA + PPTA + IPTA reported strong evidence for that background, almost certainly from supermassive BH binaries in galaxy mergers.",
      "different_domains_use_different_time_s": "Different domains use different time scales. INTERNATIONAL ATOMIC TIME (TAI) is the pure atomic standard — no leap seconds, no corrections. It is currently ~ 37 seconds ahead of UTC. TERRESTRIAL TIME (TT) is TAI + 32.184 seconds (an offset chosen to match older Ephemeris Time); TT is the standard for SOLAR-SYSTEM EPHEMERIDES (where to point a telescope to find a planet at a given moment). GEOCENTRIC COORDINATE TIME (TCG) + BARYCENTRIC COORDINATE TIME (TCB) are relativistic timescales accounting for the gravitational potential difference between Earth + the solar-system center of mass — required for high-precision positions of spacecraft, planets, + pulsars. JULIAN DATE (JD) counts days since noon Universal Time on January 1, 4713 BCE — convenient for astronomy because there are no leap years or month boundaries. Modified Julian Date (MJD) = JD - 2400000.5.",
      "differentiation_early_earth": "Differentiation + early Earth",
      "direct_nuclear_hit_if_all_else_fails_i": "Direct nuclear hit if all else fails + impact is imminent. Risk: fragments could still hit + spread the damage.",
      "discovered_the_cepheid_period_luminosi": "discovered the Cepheid period-luminosity relation while working as a \"computer\" at Harvard College Observatory (1908) — measuring photographic plates by hand. Without her work, Hubble could not have proved the universe contained other galaxies, and we would have no rung 4. She died in 1921, three years before Hubble's announcement; she was never nominated for a Nobel Prize, which she likely would have shared.",
      "disruption_of_circadian_rhythm_by_nigh": "Disruption of circadian rhythm by night-time light exposure is well-established. Even relatively dim bedroom light (10 lux, dimmer than typical streetlight scatter) suppresses melatonin production + delays sleep onset. Long-term shift workers have higher rates of breast cancer, prostate cancer, metabolic syndrome, depression — the WHO classifies night-shift work as a \"probable carcinogen\" (Group 2A) based on this evidence. For typical residents under light-polluted skies: poorer sleep quality, more sleep onset latency, more vivid morning awakenings. Children + adolescents may be particularly affected; melatonin onset shifts later, contributing to school-night sleep deficits.",
      "distance_from_us": "Distance from us",
      "diversifying_who_does_astronomy": "Diversifying who does astronomy",
      "don_page_1993_calculated_what_entangle": "ភេជបានសិក្សាព័ត៌មានដែលរំពឹងទុកក្នុងវិទ្យុសកម្មប្រហោងខ្មៅ ប្រសិនបើការបង្កើត និងការហួតរក្សាស្ថានភាពក្វង់តូមសុទ្ធ។ អង់ត្រូពីវិទ្យុសកម្មកើនឡើងដំបូង រួចបង្វែរចុះ ហើយត្រឡប់ទៅសូន្យវិញបន្ទាប់ពីការហួតយូនីតារីពេញលេញ។ ចំណុចបង្វែរពាក់ព័ន្ធនឹងតុល្យភាពរវាងអង់ត្រូពីវិទ្យុសកម្ម និងអង់ត្រូពីដែលមានសម្រាប់ប្រហោងខ្មៅនៅសល់ វាមិនមានន័យថាម៉ាសពាក់កណ្តាលបានហួតទេ។ ការគណនាកម្ដៅមូលដ្ឋានផ្ទុយទៅវិញផ្តល់អង់ត្រូពីវិទ្យុសកម្មកើនឡើងអំឡុងការហួត។ នៅឆ្នាំ ២០១៩ និង ២០២០ ការគណនាដោយប្រើផ្ទៃក្វង់តូមអតិបរមា និងរន្ធដង្កូវចម្លងបានបង្កើតខ្សែកោងភេជឡើងវិញក្នុងគំរូទំនាញដែលគ្រប់គ្រងបាន។ របៀបដែលមេរៀនទាំងនេះអនុវត្តចំពោះប្រហោងខ្មៅពិតប្រាកដនៅតែជាសំណួរស្រាវជ្រាវសកម្ម។",
