      "rb_rule": "diagnose before you replace. Every case has a wrong answer that looks obvious and costs the customer real money. Guessing right still scores badly here — because on a real car, a guess that happens to work teaches you nothing and the next one strands somebody.",
      "rb_rule_lead": "The rule this bay teaches: ",
      "rb_running": "RUNNING",
      "rb_running_hint": "Some evidence only exists now — charging voltage, whether the fan kicks in. Some inspection is unsafe now.",
      "rb_safety": "Safety violations: ",
      "rb_safety_body": "A correct diagnosis does not undo an injury. Every violation above describes something that hurts people in real bays, and the habit of checking engine state first is what prevents all of them.",
