      "eu_2010_63_was_the_first_major_jurisdi": "The UK protected the common octopus in lab research from 1993, and EU Directive 2010/63 extended research protections to all cephalopods in 2010. The UK 2022 Sentience Act asks government to consider cephalopod welfare when making policy.",
      "eu_directive_2010_63": "EU Directive 2010/63",
      "eu_directive_2010_63_eu": "EU Directive 2010/63/EU",
      "eu_directive_2010_63_first_gave_cephal": "EU Directive 2010/63 gave cephalopods the same research protections as vertebrates across the EU. UK Animal Welfare (Sentience) Act 2022 formalized sentience recognition. Washington State 2024 preemptive octopus aquaculture ban; California enacted one later in 2024 (AB 3162) and Hawaii has proposed one. Nueva Pescanova withdrew its Canary Islands farm plan in July 2026.",
      "eu_eurogroup_for_animals": "EU Eurogroup for Animals",
      "eu_law_on_lab_animals_adds_cephalopods": "EU law on lab animals adds CEPHALOPODS as the first invertebrates given protections equivalent to vertebrates — they require the same review + welfare standards for research use.",
