      "great_barracuda_accelerate_at_12_m_s_d": "Great barracuda accelerate at ~12 m/s² during a strike — comparable to a sports car off the line. They detect prey primarily by motion + silhouette, so motionless camouflaged octopuses are largely invisible to them.",
      "grimpoteuthidae": "Grimpoteuthidae",
