      "body_parts_that_share_a_common_evoluti": "Body parts that share a common evolutionary origin even if they look different — like the human arm, bat wing, and whale flipper. Same blueprint, modified for different uses.",
      "both_extremes_outperform_the_middle_ra": "Both extremes outperform the middle. Rare in nature — happens when two distinct food sources favor different specialists, with intermediates losing both.",
