      "male_peacocks_have_absurd_tail_trains_": "Male peacocks have absurd tail trains — 5 feet long, with up to 200 eyespots. The tail makes flying harder and attracts predators. Why do they have it? Female peahens prefer it. The tail evolved because females consistently picked the showiest males for thousands of generations.",
