      "corrector_s_margin_mark": "Corrector’s margin mark: ",
      "cost_is_relative_a_full_leather_bindin": "Cost is relative — a full-leather binding on a 1500-page folio runs about 100× a paperback on a 32-page pamphlet. Labor scales with both binding choice + page count. Expected life with normal handling reflects what conservation experience says: a properly-bound full-leather book from 1500 can still be read in 2026, while a paperback from 2000 may already be falling apart.",
