      "the_eagle_scream_you_hear_in_movies_is": "The \"eagle scream\" you hear in movies is almost always a red-tail dubbed over a bald eagle clip — Hollywood corrects the bird's actual unimpressive voice.",
      "the_exponential_approach_to_terminal_v": "The exponential approach to terminal velocity is the signature of drag-limited fall. Without drag, the bird would just accelerate at g forever. With drag, terminal is reached + held.",
      "the_famous_total_darkness_barn_owl_str": "The famous total-darkness barn owl strike experiment. First demonstration of acoustic localization accurate to ~1° in pitch black.",
      "the_first_scientific_treatise_on_falco": "The first scientific treatise on falconry + raptor biology — also one of the first scientific texts in Western Europe.",
      "the_foundational_paper_on_logarithmic_": "The foundational paper on logarithmic-spiral stoop trajectories. Demonstrated peregrines fly a constant-retinal-angle approach matching the proportional-navigation algorithm used by air-to-air missiles.",
      "the_hunt_continues": "The hunt continues.",
      "the_iconic_raptor_call_in_american_med": "THE iconic raptor call in American media. Dubbed in over bald eagles, golden eagles, ospreys — even owls in Hollywood films.",
      "the_is_it_a_raptor_debate": "🔬 The \"is it a raptor?\" debate: ",
      "the_largest_single_educational_raptor_": "The Largest Single Educational Raptor Tool Ever Built",
      "the_left_opening_sits_higher_on_the_sk": " — the left opening sits higher on the skull than the right by ~1 cm in barn owls. Sound arriving from above hits the left ear first by ~30 microseconds; sound from below hits the right ear first. The brain reads the time difference as ",
      "the_logarithmic_spiral_approach_keeps_": "The logarithmic spiral approach keeps the prey at a CONSTANT angle to the falcon's body axis. The bird never needs to turn its head — eyes stay fixed forward through deep fovea, body stays streamlined, the prey appears motionless relative to the falcon. This is exactly the proportional-navigation algorithm used by AIM-9 Sidewinder + similar guided missiles, derived for the same reason: ",
      "the_long_hawk_mountain_dataset_1934_no": "The long Hawk Mountain dataset (1934-now) will continue being the canonical evidence base for documenting these shifts.",
      "the_mechanism_is_exactly_the_diagram_i": "The mechanism is exactly the diagram in the Day Eye vs Night Eye section: ",
      "the_original_1934_raptor_sanctuary_vis": "The original 1934 raptor sanctuary. Visit during fall migration to see thousands of broadwings + sharp-shins funneling along the Kittatinny Ridge. 8 lookouts + free public access mid-Aug to mid-Dec.",
      "the_owl_gliding_through_twilight": "The owl gliding through twilight. ",
      "the_owl_s_noise_peak_at_16_khz_sits_pa": "The owl's noise peak at 16 kHz sits past the mouse's sharp drop-off in hearing sensitivity. The hawk's noise peak at 3 kHz sits exactly where the mouse hears best. This is what \"silent flight\" really means in physics: not zero amplitude — frequency shifted out of the prey's perceptual band.",
      "the_peregrine_on_the_cliff": "The peregrine on the cliff. ",
      "the_proportional_navigation_algorithm_": " the proportional-navigation algorithm used by air-to-air missiles. Adjust the parameters below + watch the falcon close on its prey.",
      "the_story": "📖 The Story",
      "the_tool_tells_you_what_hunt_strategy_": " + ឧបករណ៍ប្រាប់អ្នកថាយុទ្ធសាស្ត្របរបាញ់ណាសមនឹងរាងកាយនោះ។ ប្រៀបធៀបនឹងប្រភេទសត្វពិត។ ភាពស៊ីគ្នាយ៉ាងល្អឥតខ្ចោះរវាងធរណីមាត្ររាងកាយ + អាកប្បកិរិយា គឺជាការយល់ដឹងស្នូលនៃជីវវិទ្យាហោះហើរសត្វស្លាបស៊ីសាច់។",
      "their_existence_is_a_gift_their_declin": "Their existence is a gift. Their decline would be a loss we cannot undo. ",
