      "these_are_simplifications_real_raptor_": "These are simplifications — real raptor vision also has 2 foveas per eye, wider visual field, UV in falconids, and head-mounting that lets the bird scan with much less head motion than a human. The acuity number is just ONE axis of \"better seeing.\"",
      "they_are_looking_back_at_you": "They are looking back at you. ",
