      "lane_keeping": "Lane Keeping",
      "lap_belt_should_ride_on_your_hip_bones": "Lap belt should ride on your HIP BONES, never on your soft stomach. Shoulder belt should cross your collarbone at the center of your shoulder — never under the arm or behind the back. Pull any slack out.",
      "large_objects_appear_to_move_slower_th": "វត្ថុធំមើលទៅដូចជាផ្លាស់ទីយឺតជាងល្បឿនពិត។ រថភ្លើងដែលអ្នកស្មានថា \"នៅឆ្ងាយ និងយឺត\" ជាធម្មតារត់ក្នុងល្បឿន ៤៥–៨០ ម៉ាយ/ម៉ោង — គឺ ៦៦ ដល់ ១១៧ ហ្វីតរៀងរាល់វិនាទី ដូច្នេះវាបិទចម្ងាយ ១,០០០ ហ្វីតចុងក្រោយក្នុងរយៈពេលប្រហែល ៩ ដល់ ១៥ វិនាទី។",
      "large_trucks_school_buses_and_emergenc": "Large trucks, school buses, and emergency vehicles often need to track both lanes of a multi-lane roundabout to clear the curb. Don't crowd them or try to pass inside.",
      "lean_to_the_center_adjust_the_right_mi": "Lean to the center. Adjust the right mirror the same way. When you sit normally, BOTH side mirrors show your blind spots.",
      "lean_your_head_to_the_left_window_adju": "Lean your head to the left window. Adjust the left mirror until you can JUST see the edge of your car. Sit back — now the mirror shows your blind spot, not the side of your car.",
