      "spot_them_from_shore_the_parallel_to_s": "Spot them from shore. The parallel-to-shore escape. Why fighting the current kills.",
      "spread_your_weight_if_you_have_ice_pic": "Spread your weight. If you have ice picks (Picks of Life), use them now to get traction.",
