      "wider_bead": "• Wider bead",
      "wire_diameter_selection": "💡 Wire diameter selection",
      "word_of_mouth_facebook_marketplace_fir": "Word-of-mouth + Facebook marketplace. First year is hard. Year 2-3 typically much better.",
      "work_environment": "Work environment: ",
      "workbench_that_pulls_fume_downward_goo": "Workbench that pulls fume downward. Good for parts you can move to it.",
      "worked_example_verify_by_hand": "Worked Example — verify by hand",
      "working_at_depth_on_compressed_gas_the": "Working at depth on compressed gas, the diver-welder must follow strict ascent / decompression schedules. \"Bends\" can cause permanent neurological damage or death. Hyperbaric work uses saturation diving.",
      "workmanship_cleaning_fit_up_preheat_in": "Workmanship: cleaning, fit-up, preheat, interpass, tacks, cleaning between passes.",
      "worn_welding_leads_exposing_copper_dam": "Worn welding leads exposing copper, damaged work clamps, cracked electrode holders = direct contact path. Inspect every shift. Replace cables when insulation cracks (don't patch).",
      "wps_position_e_g_6g_material_thickness": "WPS, position (e.g., 6G), material thickness, process. Each combination is its own qualification.",
      "wps_pqr_requirements_essential_variabl": "WPS + PQR requirements. ESSENTIAL variables that require requalification if changed (base metal type, filler metal, electrode classification, joint design, position, electrical characteristics, technique).",
      "x_ray_electronic": "X-ray (electronic): ",
      "x_ray_inspection": "X-ray inspection: ",
      "x_ray_view_of_penetration_haz_crown": "— X-ray view of penetration + HAZ + crown",
      "x_rays_generated_by_accelerating_elect": "X-rays generated by accelerating electrons. Source can be turned off when not in use. Used in shops + controlled environments. Better image quality.",
      "yaskawa_motoman": "Yaskawa Motoman",
      "you_can_t_see_fine_detail_once_the_arc": "You can't see fine detail once the arc is lit — you set up your torch position, work angle, and travel speed BEFORE striking, then run by muscle memory + the small visible region around the pool. That is what years of practice build.",
      "you_decoded_all_parts_of_this_symbol_c": "You decoded all parts of this symbol correctly. Move on to the next challenge.",
      "you_get_a_welder_performance_qualifica": "You get a Welder Performance Qualification card good for 6 months (extends with documented continuous use).",
      "you_ll_be_welding_on_for_the_next_year": " you'll be welding on for the next year is parked on stands the size of school buses. It is bigger than you imagined and somehow also smaller — closer up than the photos. Inside, the smell hits first: hot metal, weld fume, machine oil. The sound second: arc gouging from two bays over (a sound like the world's loudest staple gun), grinders, the ventilation rumble.",
      "you_need_a_brace_at_30_from_horizontal": "You need a brace at 30° from horizontal, climbing 12\" vertical. Hypotenuse (brace length) = 12 / sin(30°) = 12 / 0.5 = 24\". Horizontal run = 12 / tan(30°) = 12 / 0.577 = 20.78\".",
      "you_re_in_the_water_the_torch_is_in_th": "You're in the water. The torch is in the water. The metal is in the water. Stick (SMAW) is the dominant process — the flux coating creates a tiny gas bubble around the arc that excludes water just long enough to fuse the metal. Used for emergency repairs, inspection follow-up work, and routine maintenance on offshore structures.",
      "your_answers": "Your answers",
      "your_assignor_walks_you_onto_the_deck_": "Your assignor walks you onto the deck. The ",
      "your_defect_catalog": "Your Defect Catalog",
      "your_own_shop": "🛠 Your own shop",
      "your_personal_log_of_every_defect_type": "Your personal log of every defect type you have ID'd",
      "your_pick": "✗ your pick",
      "your_pick_2": "✗ your pick",
