      "dh2_hint": "Where to look: {value1}",
      "dh2_how_1": "Is it IN the metal (a hole, groove or crack) or just ON the surface (droplets, colour, chalk, scale)?",
      "dh2_how_2": "Is metal MISSING (a pit or a groove) or is there EXTRA metal (a lip or a lump)?",
      "dh2_how_3": "Where is it: the crown, a toe, the start or the end crater?",
      "dh2_how_4": "Some flaws never reach the surface. A narrow, humped stretch of bead is a reason to cut and etch there.",
