      "insp2_done_all": "All eight calls right. That is Part B thinking: measure the worst spot, find the rule, apply its exact words.",
      "insp2_done_some": "Review the welds marked ✗. Most wrong calls come from stopping at the first reading, or forgetting that undercut, undersize and porosity also limit total length.",
