      "metal10_scene_aria": "Section through the upper wall of a stainless pipe joint. The face is outside, below the torch; the root is inside, above the backing gas. Highlighted: {value1}.",
      "metal10_source_miller": "Miller · stainless pipe shielding and purging",
      "metal10_source_twi": "TWI · root oxidation and backing gas",
