      "pipe2_ch_done": "✓ All three found. Now compare 6G: same clock, plus a slope.",
      "pipe2_ch_intro": "Three quick checks on a 5G joint. Answer by picking an o'clock above.",
      "pipe2_ch_locked": "Challenge on: the explorer is showing 5G.",
      "pipe2_ch_n": "Check {value1} of {value2}: ",
