      "safe5_vent_aria": "Distance schematic: fixed arc at the ruler origin. The hood illustrates the midpoint of the {value1} band, which is paired with {value2} cfm in the reference table. Outlined bands show both reference distance ranges. No fume removal is simulated.",
      "safe5_vent_distance_caption": "Distance from the arc, in inches. Only this distance uses the scale; torch, hood and duct outlines are schematic. The hood is drawn at the selected band’s midpoint to illustrate the band, not a measured position.",
      "safe5_vent_far": "10–12 in reference",
