      "shop3_hearing": "Grinding station",
      "shop3_hearing_clue": "Check the hearing-protection supply, the work rule and the double-protection provision.",
      "shop3_help": "Choose a numbered station. Inspect your actual shop, then record evidence with the original audit questions. Each answer also updates the checklist below.",
      "shop3_model_note": "The scene reflects your reported observations. Bright controls mean Recorded Yes, not verified protection; faint controls mean unconfirmed, Recorded No or N/A. Completing the checklist does not approve a shop or measure exposure.",
