      "stainless_wire_brush_immediately_befor_r2": "Stainless wire brush IMMEDIATELY before welding, using a brush DEDICATED to aluminum (a brush used on mild steel contaminates it). A thin oxide starts re-forming at once and thickens with time, so weld soon after brushing and re-clean parts that have sat for hours.",
