      "tech2_rob_run": "▶ Run program",
      "tech2_rob_shift_explain": "The part arrived 5 mm off and the robot did exactly what it was taught: it welded where the seam USED to be. This is why cells use seam finding. Turn on seam tracking and run the same program again.",
      "tech2_rob_shift_off": "Load the next part 5 mm off (off)",
