      "fig_fo_aria": "Three coral shapes in the 1998 bleaching off Okinawa. Branching corals were hit hardest, while many boulder and encrusting corals survived. These are tendencies: boulder corals can die too. Below, a reef before and after: it keeps some coral but has fewer kinds.",
