      "fig_ht_wreck": "Shipwreck",
      "fig_hw_aria": "Two comparisons from the Great Barrier Reef. Reefs in cleaner water recovered faster after damage than reefs in murky water. Where divers removed coral-eating crown-of-thorns starfish early and thoroughly, coral cover rose instead of falling.",
